4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xUwao4ZryMkQ7kNvwFxue65&_nc_oc=AdoXt7L-UWKKwS5ulOLA1XZ1zWKc8e5w7_bkhIlWCysHI3Zo7-OjEDx5oA4jXxtE6yI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBhJYIW1EElb2Kqtxx0BwxSC8nLaSiGkKmLWVc_Ao2ndw&oe=6A4E4AD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=25FSLAqPfCUQ7kNvwHsPJBk&_nc_oc=Ado_FHWsGAy_FyNt3f3jpq90C0m9JFmvT-Mn8c8GR3uFMgyzrBtXH5s_bKxPIgdSQaY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQARjuaB1XHDpJ4VRy2ynaZt3SStp3RpHo5XVt7wfeHAhg&oe=6A4E4FB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2x0AR-e6Sg8Q7kNvwEFjy6w&_nc_oc=AdoNuWTKa8oxGpQ0SKxuhQC5BtznqCQJjCv4KaoqDn85Zj353qe791p0wnKtTq3IeTs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQClLafHsu5FMMtOzeUqwKmWGQi9nPpLvroKHMWt-nc7xQ&oe=6A4E5D55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p